<title>HONG KONG: Wong's Kong King 1996 net up 113.34 pct.</title>
<headline>Wong's Kong King 1996 net up 113.34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.99	vs  2.00 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.06 loss vs  40.85 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    21.46     vs  10.06</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,479.05  vs  2,314.70</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wong's Kong King International</p>
<p>				     (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Wong's Kong King trades chemicals and equipment used in the manufacture of electronic products.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on closure of part of a food business in China.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for the rights issue during 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
